 "introductions": [
  {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "あらすじ",
   "body": [
    {
     "intro": "今回のクエスト「領主が不当に財産をためこんでいるので、締め上げて回収すること」<br />\n内容は簡単なものだったが、領主を追い詰めたところ罠が仕掛けられていた。<br />\n落とし穴の先は地下迷宮。屋敷の下にこんなものを作っているとは…。<br />\n<br />\nとはいえ、田舎貴族のつくったチャチなダンジョン、出てくる魔物もザコばかり。<br />\n大魔法使いリッカにとってみれば、脱出なんてアクビが出るわ!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "ゲーム内容",
   "body": [
    {
     "intro": "シンプルなダンジョンRPGです。<br />\n敵を倒して出口を目指しましょう。<br />\n主人公はまず負けないぐらい強いですが、イベントをこなすとステータスが下がってしまいます。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "text_list",
   "title": "ボリューム",
   "body": [
    {
     "intro": "Hシーン数:4"
    },
    {
     "intro": "基本CG数:5"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "システム",
   "body": [
    {
     "intro": "フルHD(1920x1080)対応<br />\nメッセージスキップ、巻き戻し、オート再生機能<br />\nシーン回想、CG閲覧、全開放ボタン<br />\nUnity WebGL同梱<br />\n本作品はUnityで製作されています。<br />\n<br />\nPublished on Steam by OTAKU Plan<br />\n<a href=\"https://twitter.com/otaku_plan\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/otaku_plan</a>"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "English",
   "body": [
    {
     "intro": "【Summary】<br />\nThe quest this time is to arrest a local lord who has been fraudulently amassing wealth, as well as to confiscate said wealth.<br />\nThough this is an easy sounding job, the lord's stronghold is full of traps.<br />\nOne such trap, a pitfall trap, leads to an underground dungeon. Who could have expected him to build something like this under his home?<br />\n<br />\nHowever, this is just some local noble, and so the monsters in his dungeon are pretty weak.<br />\nFor an archmage like Ricka, escaping is the simplest thing ever!<br />\n<br />\n【Game outline】<br />\nThis is a simple dungeon crawler RPG.<br />\nLook for the exit while defeating enemies you encounter on the way.<br />\nThe protagonist starts out so strong she won't ever lose, but with each event her stats will drop.<br />\n<br />\n【Content】<br />\nH scenes: 4<br />\nBase CG count: 5<br />\n<br />\n【System】<br />\nSupports Full HD (1920x1080)<br />\nFunctionality for skipping, rewinding and auto-playing messages<br />\nScene and CG galleries<br />\nIncludes Unity WebGL<br />\nBase code written in Unity."
    }
   ]
  }
 ],
